$A203 t CreditsMessage ; The menu scroller's text: "DEFLEKTOR , WRITTEN BY COSTA PANAYI ... SELECT OPTION ,,, ", a pause, again
> Set by OptionsMenu `$A757` (`$A76E`). `@` is the copyright sign in the font (`$D300`). Text: DEFLEKTOR , WRITTEN BY COSTA PANAYI , WITH HELP FROM THE ALIEN , MUSIC BY BEN AND JOBBEE , @1987 VORTEX SOFTWARE ,,, SELECT OPTION ,,, .
> Evidence: read in `c1g`, `controls`, `kempston`, `menu`, `energy`; the whole text and the pause only in `controls` (the longest wait on the panel).
