$A28E t HighRatingMessage ; The name-entry prompt: "HIGH DEFLEKTOR RATING ", a pause, ", PLEASE ENTER YOUR NAME , ", again
> Set by `$9CB4` for a hall-of-fame entry, which writes `$FE` to the pause first (`$9CAE`). Evidence: `rzx-344752` (the RZX player's entry).
@res texts/messages.bin
$A2A4 RatingPause ; $FE: the pause, as CreditsPause
